			<div class="content" id="post-content-4022556">
									

<p>The article isn't actually supposed to be highlighted, fwiw. Each tab is an extant SCP in the mainlist. What is visible on the page is what's meant to be read.</p>
<p>That being said, it is still a pain in the ass to parse. I would very much like an abridged version, even in the forum here, that excises all the blanks.</p>
<p>My instinct is to downvote due to readability, but at the same time, reading through this with all the breaks creates a very odd and unsettling effect that made it suprisingly enjoyable.</p>

