			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4022564">
									

<p>Yeah, this threw me off - I would have instantly downvoted for having a totally unreadable article until I realised it was irrelevant. It's not very elegant to have masses of stuff on a page which isn't supposed to be read, though, and will inevitably throw people off.</p>
<p>I remember this being posted when it was all blackboxes, and at least this is better. Even without the text, though, it's still a slog to get through, and I didn't really enjoy the story fully, although it seems interesting. Perhaps replace the text with blank space or white blackboxes?</p>
<p><span style="color:#f5f5f5">██</span></p>
<p>I'm going to upvote this actually, I'm not sure if I <em>like</em> it, but the novelty of constructing something out of the words of all your other SCPs and the stupid amount of effort involved deserves something.</p>

